    "created_at": "2016-11-09T17:59:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-11-09T17:59:52Z",
    "body": "If there is a problem with CSS multicolumn, I suggest you bring it up with the CSSWG. CSS multicolumn is implemented and maintained, so no need for HTML to work around problems with it.\n\nThe OP lists \"possible\" use cases; I suggest these are not particularly common requests and we should not change HTML to address them. Any change to HTML has a [cost](https://wiki.whatwg.org/wiki/FAQ#Where.27s_the_harm_in_adding.E2.80.94) and in this case I don't really see much benefit.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
